  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a repost of my last post made back in February, but the issue seems to have yet been fixed. Just like in the last post, after loading into a world's instance and either; idling or moving around, my screen would fade to black and I would then be loaded back into my set home world. I have tested this on both Steam's and Oculus's Desktop and VR Mode, all four results have been the same. Every update given out I would test this again and each have always been the same, load into a world, give it about one or two minutes, and bam, disconnected. I even went as far as to get a VPN like support told me to way back then, but that only made things worse, and burn money out of my account.\nBelow I linked a pastebin of the recent output log for anyone who cares to see or can use it to figure out a fix\nhttps://pastebin.com/Uv6kRWSy",
